            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Account deletion that works with Google sign-in

FIXED
Accounts signed in with Google can now be deleted in Settings, under Security.

CHANGED
Deleting your account now asks for confirmation in a single dialog, without another sign-in or a typed confirmation.
]]></description>
